  "sharedAssertions": [
    "对usable/stale，recordBytes和markdownBytes用read_bytes长度独立计算；currentSourceBytesRead等于当前最新CSV原文encode长度总和，逐源hashlib.sha256等于登记。",
    "measuredReadBytes=recordBytes+markdownBytes+currentSourceBytesRead；uniqueFilesRead=2+currentSourceFilesRead；不可拿包文件数与逻辑引用数做不等式。",
    "includeMarkdown只有usable存在，markdown.encode(UTF-8)==保存包read_bytes；默认不含markdown；stale/blocked/failed不含正文。",
    "wrong-project和missing-package对外404/error.code相同，错误响应不含目标查询/项目/path/hash/body。",
    "对完整范围核验成功，logicalReferencesChecked=len(saved snapshot.selectedRecords)，uniqueReferencedSourceFiles=不同path数量；这些来自既有M4E保存内容而非M4F输出。",
    "原件和包核验前后SHA不变，不产生新登记/知识版本。"
  ]
